
* ==========================================================
* EXPERIMENT 2C
* TRANSISTOR-LEVEL SRAM BUTTERFLY CURVE
* Hold SNM preparation
* ==========================================================

* Supply voltage
VDD VDD 0 1.8

* Input voltage for DC sweep
VIN IN 0 0

* CMOS inverter - NMOS
MN OUT IN 0 0 NM W=2u L=0.18u

* CMOS inverter - PMOS
MP OUT IN VDD VDD PM W=4u L=0.18u

* Generic Level-1 MOSFET models
.model NM NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=200u LAMBDA=0.02)
.model PM PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.02)

* Mirrored inverter characteristic
* This mirrors the transistor-level VTC about
* the centre of the 1.8V supply range.
BMIR MIR 0 V=1.8-V(OUT)

* DC sweep
.dc VIN 0 1.8 1m

* Save simulation data
.save V(IN) V(OUT) V(MIR)

.end
